Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A blue glow radiates through the brass spirals at the end of this heavy club.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/40px-D8_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/53px-D8_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/D8_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">1d8 + 2 (3~10) + <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Roll#Modifiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Roll\">Strength modifier</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a hre